I take my big bag.
I go into the bedroom.
There is good light in the room.
There is a wooden wardrobe there.
The wardrobe sits near the window.
I open that wardrobe.
I take the clothes from the bag.
I put the clothes in the wardrobe.
The clothes sit neatly in the wardrobe.
My shirts sit on top.
The pants sit below.
Now my bag is empty.
There is a new bed in the room.
I put the empty bag under the bed.
The big bag lies flat under the bed.
Now the bedroom is very tidy.
I like this new room a lot.
